{"id":"87846ecce8309a1b","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order.md","title":"ZFC Order7 Complete Partial Order","display":"df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order — ZFC Order7 Complete Partial Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order — ZFC Order7 Complete Partial Order","depends_on":["[[58-df-cpo]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order — ZFC Order7 Complete Partial Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2e0e7710413332a\" href=\"?note=d2e0e7710413332a\" title=\"58-df-cpo\">58-df-cpo</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (ordered carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R)\\)</span> is the canonical complete-partial-order predicate, including a least element and suprema of all nonempty directed subsets (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d2e0e7710413332a\" href=\"?note=d2e0e7710413332a\" title=\"58-df-cpo\">58-df-cpo</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7CompletePartialOrder}_S(X,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7CompletePartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\)</span> (abbreviation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}complete\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7CompletePartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}complete\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7CompletePartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The numbered compatibility name now has the same convention as the book's canonical CPO predicate; in particular, it no longer silently drops the required bottom element.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d2e0e7710413332a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cpo]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d2e0e7710413332a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R)$ is the canonical complete-partial-order predicate, including a least element and suprema of all nonempty directed subsets (see [[58-df-cpo]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7CompletePartialOrder}_S(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order7\\text{-}complete\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder7CompletePartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CPO}_S(X,R).","display":true}],"bytes":1052,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2952","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order.md|58-df-zfc-order7-complete-partial-order]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d2e0e7710413332a"]}